chip is esp32.
module is esp32-wroom-32.
board is devkit-v1.
wifi is off.
bluetooth is off.
console is on uart0.
gpio 4 is input "button" with internal pull-up.
machine sensor starts in idle.
state idle: on button press go to measuring.
state measuring: every 10 s do read sensor; on read ok go to idle; after 3 read failed go to error.
state error: on button press go to idle; after 30 s go to idle.
